e (CVA) condition effectively.\n\nOn March 2, 2023, Ms. Reid's visit showed a blood pressure of 140/73 mmHg, and she weighed 145 pounds. She was doing well and reported no new symptoms. neurologic examination was stable, and she continues to manage her Stroke (CVA) without complications.\n\nIn terms of her social history, Ms. Reid used to smoke cigarettes, with a habit of 10 cigarettes per day, which she on March 28, 2024. She also consumes alcohol, about 10 drinks per week.\n\nThis summary reflects Ms. Reid's ongoing management and stable condition related to her history of Stroke (CVA). She continues"
